    {
      "speaker": "透",
      "text": "……あー、風、冷たくなってきた。夕焼け、なんかすごい色だね",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "tooru",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "020",
      "clothId": "020",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait1",
      "charAnim2": "face_serious",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_01",
        "zh": "……啊，风变凉了。晚霞的颜色，好厉害啊。",
        "speakerZh": "浅仓透",
        "surfaceEmotion": "calm_neutral",
        "innerEmotion": "resolve_quiet",
        "vocalTone": "calm_even",
        "x-editor-filter": "dusk",
        "note": "开启黄昏滤镜 dusk，透仰望天边",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞下的归途",
        "stageAction": "dusk_mood"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "小糸",
      "text": "わ、わっ！ 透ちゃん、立ち止まったら皆に遅れちゃいますよぉ……！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "koito",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "022",
      "clothId": "022",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "shy1",
      "charAnim2": "face_shy",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
      "lip": "lip_shy",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_02",
        "zh": "哇、哇！透，要是停下来的话会落大家一截的啦……！",
        "speakerZh": "福丸小糸",
        "surfaceEmotion": "shy_flustered",
        "innerEmotion": "affection_bashful",
        "vocalTone": "breath_flutter",
        "x-editor-filter": "dusk",
        "note": "小糸小跑跟上",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞下的归途"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "円香",
      "text": "別に急ぐ必要もないでしょう、小糸。……空が赤いのも、いつものことだし",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "madoka",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "021",
      "clothId": "021",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait3",
      "charAnim2": "face_close",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_03",
        "zh": "也不用特意赶时间吧，小糸。……天空泛红什么的，本来也是常有的事。",
        "speakerZh": "樋口円香",
        "surfaceEmotion": "troubled_sigh",
        "innerEmotion": "guarded_distance",
        "vocalTone": "sigh_trail",
        "x-editor-filter": "dusk",
        "note": "円香平静接话",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞下的归途"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "小糸",
      "text": "えへへ、そうだよね！ 円香ちゃんも一緒に並んで歩こうよ、雛菜ちゃんも来てくれるし！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "koito",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "022",
      "clothId": "022",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_left",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_04",
        "zh": "诶嘿嘿，也是呢！円香也一起并肩走吧，雏菜马上也要过来了！",
        "speakerZh": "福丸小糸",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "x-editor-filter": "dusk",
        "note": "小糸开心地张望",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "晚霞下的归途"
      }
    },
